Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||04-22-99||03:53 PM||||Hi All!<p>I just wanted y'all to know that this forum has just passed the 100 registered members mark! As you may or may not know, this Forum only started 3 months ago and is now averaging 2-3 new members every day! I'm glad it's taking off and I really should thank the regular posters (you know who you are!) and especially <b>Ogre</b> who has been supplying us with a wealth of information!<p>Ogre and I have been discussing some additions to the forum, mainly a place where you could find interesting articles about our beloved Fiero - a place that would answer a lot of questions beforehand. I have already received some material from Ogre and as soon as time permits, I will create a place for this.<p>Anyway, keep on posting!
