Z||000002||theogre||04-22-99||06:16 PM||||You're welcome Cliff. BTW, hold that item just a bit... I found a couple things to add today. (the color code changes from year to year for one.)<p>As for the growth....... YYYYYEEEEEEEEEEEEEEESSSSSSSSSSS!!!!!!!!!!! This is the only forum yet to use a decent software. The only other one close is PFKB. most others use stinking "guest book" setups. Do you know how flaming long it takes to wade thru those. By the time you find the answer you forgot what the question was.<p>In the computer biz, we have NoWonder which uses ultimate, and ZDnet which uses Dejanews now i think. Both are excelent sources of data. I've gotten so I won't even surf "guest book" systems any more.
